  "body": "## What's Changed\n* Speed up and harden the CI Playwright browser install by @EricWittmann in https://github.com/Apitomy/apitomy-flow/pull/176\n* Record and show per-visit node inputs in the workflow viewer by @EricWittmann in https://github.com/Apitomy/apitomy-flow/pull/175\n* Update dependency @types/node to v26.6.4 by @renovate[bot] in https://github.com/Apitomy/apitomy-flow/pull/160\n* Update dependency vite to v8.3.3 by @renovate[bot] in https://github.com/Apitomy/apitomy-flow/pull/163\n* Update dependency eslint to v10.12.0 by @renovate[bot] in https://github.com/Apitomy/apitomy-flow/pull/164\n* Update dependency @vitejs/plugin-react to v6.1.2 by @renovate[bot] in https://github.com/Apitomy/apitomy-flow/pull/168\n* Update dependency typescript-eslint to v8.71.1 by @renovate[bot] in https://github.com/Apitomy/apitomy-flow/pull/169\n* Add an optional EL title to human-task nodes by @EricWittmann in https://github.com/Apitomy/apitomy-flow/pull/177\n\n\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/Apitomy/apitomy-flow/compare/v2.6.0...v2.7.0",
